  "features": [
    "Automatic typing after a stable released startup baseline",
    "Four profiles with the physical 36-key Main map and transparent Fn1/Fn2 defaults",
    "Fixed-point per-key calibration, Hall coefficients and asymmetric Rapid Trigger",
    "SOCD, Rappy Snappy, four-phase DKS, Mod Tap, Toggle, Combination, Macro, Multi-Point Trigger and End Key",
    "ADC1 twelve-rank DMA modes and scan timing telemetry",
    "Immediate report pacing from 125 to 8000 Hz and verified journal saves at a reduced flash clock",
    "Optional Xbox-compatible XInput controller, both sticks, triggers, ten buttons and D-pad",
    "AE64 analog ranges, four-point curves, digital hysteresis, opposition and radial dead zones",
    "Controller-only, mixed and off modes with release guards and automatic USB visibility switching",
    "PA9/PA10 power sequence, PB15 key RGB, PB5 five-LED lightbar, six effects and bounded transfer retry",
    "CRC and commit-last two-page library",
    "29-byte NKRO report with an eight-byte boot report on the host\u2019s SET_PROTOCOL request",
    "DMA1 clock and ADC source verification before the first scan",
    "Independent lightbar timing and fixed half-rate keyboard LED signaling",
    "Primed DMA scan with extra first-bank settling",
    "Per-key calibration and physical RGB feedback"
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Hardware scan rate, USB enumeration/cadence and millimeter accuracy require measurement",
    "USB report cadence is a firmware cap; inherited interrupt descriptors are unchanged for EP1 and vendor interfaces",
    "Windows XInput binding and physical controller reports require hardware validation",
    "Eight action rules per profile, macros bounded to four taps",
    "Inherited OEM recovery writer remains unverified",
    "Full-image flash clears the journal; restore user exports separately",
    "Diagnostic build. Physical onboard Save remains unverified."
  ],
